 "ऊरुदघ्न mfn. (-घ्नः-घ्ना-घ्नं) As high as the thigh.\n E. ऊरु and दघ्नच् affix; also\nऊरुद्वयस and ऊरुमात्र, with द्वयसच् and मात्रच् affs.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "uruparvan": [{"id": "Uruparvvan", "headword": "ऊरुपर्व्वन्", "headword_slp1": "Uruparvvan", "fold": "uruparvan", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "ऊरुपर्व्वन् n. (-र्व्व) The knee.\n E. ऊरु and पर्व्वन् a joint.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ऊरुपर्वन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["Uruparvan"]}], "urustamBa": [{"id": "UrustamBa", "headword": "ऊरुस्तम्भ", "headword_slp1": "UrustamBa", "fold": "urustamBa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "ऊरुस्तम्भ m. (-म्भः)\n 1. Paralysis of the lower extremities.\n 2. Rheumatism\nof the thigh.\n f. (-म्भा) The plantain tree.\n E. ऊरु and स्तम्भ a post.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ऊरुस्तम्भः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["UrustamBaH"]}]}